"Make a new example with a bigger number and explain what stays the same." = "用更大的数字做一个新例子，说说什么没有变。";
"Find a second example and explain what in the words or pictures supports your idea." = "再找一个例子，说说哪些文字或图画支持你的想法。";
"Invent a seated or gentler version and explain how you made it easier to follow." = "想一个坐着做或更轻柔的版本，说说你怎样让它更好跟上。";
"Predict what might change in a different example, then say what you would look for to check." = "预测换个例子会有什么变化，再说说可以观察什么来验证。";
"Add details that would help someone who wasn't there picture or understand it." = "补充几个细节，让没在场的人也能想象或理解。";
"Test your instructions with a different starting choice and explain any fix you make." = "换一个起点来测试你的指令，并说明你做了什么调整。";
"Try to find an example that challenges your first answer and decide if you would revise it." = "找个与你最初答案不符的例子，看看要不要修改答案。";
"Change one part of your design and compare how well the two versions work." = "改动设计的一部分，比较两个版本的效果。";
"Compare two observations and explain what evidence would help answer a new question." = "比较两次观察，说说什么证据能帮助回答一个新问题。";
"Imagine changing the quantity or order and explain what you would need to adjust." = "想象改变用量或顺序，说说哪些地方也要调整。";
"Make a second version with one change and ask someone to identify what you changed." = "做第二个版本，只改一个地方，让别人听听哪里变了。";
"Change one detail and explain how it changes what happens later." = "改动一个细节，说说它怎样影响后面的情节。";
"Try a different example and explain what changed and what stayed the same." = "换一个例子，说说什么变了、什么没变。";
